| !Run for dhewm3 (the Doom 3 engine) on RISC OS: the launcher on the icon bar.
| Click its icon to play; without game data it offers to download the free Doom 3 demo.
| The game itself is started by the launcher through the Obey file Game.
Set dhewm3$Dir <Obey$Dir>
IconSprites <dhewm3$Dir>.!Sprites

RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 IfThere System:Modules.SharedULib Then RMLoad System:Modules.SharedULib
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 Error dhewm3 needs SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 or later (from PackMan)
RMEnsure ARMEABISupport 1.03 IfThere System:Modules.ARMEABISupport Then RMLoad System:Modules.ARMEABISupport
RMEnsure ARMEABISupport 1.03 Error dhewm3 needs ARMEABISupport 1.03 or later (from PackMan)
RMEnsure RISC3D 0.05 Error dhewm3 needs !RISC3D (RISC3D 0.05 or later) in !Boot.Resources, to draw with the GPU

WimpSlot -min 2048K -max 2048K
Run <dhewm3$Dir>.!RunImage %*0 2>/<dhewm3$Dir>/launcherlog
